The document renderer's golden corpus (D32), rendered by test/doc/corpus.zig
against test/golden/doc/.

- readme.md: siv's own README at the time it was added (MIT, siv).
- rss-*.html: RSS and Atom item bodies written for this corpus to mimic
  what feeds carry (WordPress, a newsletter platform, a forum digest):
  unclosed tags, inline styles, stray entities, tables for layout.
- se/: chapter 1 of The Strange Case of Dr. Jekyll and Mr. Hyde from
  Standard Ebooks (https://standardebooks.org), with its style sheets.
  The text is in the public domain; Standard Ebooks dedicates its markup
  and CSS to the public domain (CC0 1.0).
